    "primary": "Angular v22 major series; official release documentation lists v22 as active and v21 as LTS on the date checked.",
    "compatibility": "For Angular 22.0.x, the official compatibility table lists supported Node.js major ranges ^22.22.3, ^24.15.0 or ^26.0.0; TypeScript >=6.0.0 <6.1.0; RxJS ^6.5.3 or ^7.4.0. Recheck the compatibility table for the selected patch/minor before setup.",
    "signal_forms": "Signal Forms are covered as a modern version-gated topic in Angular v22+; continue to teach template-driven and reactive forms for existing applications.",
    "zoneless": "Zoneless change detection is the default in Angular v21+; older project configurations may differ.",
    "animations": "Teach animate.enter/animate.leave as the modern focus and keep legacy @angular/animations APIs in the migration track; consult current deprecations."
